<title>USA: PacifiCare Health completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>PacifiCare Health completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc of Cypress, Calif. said Tuesday it completed the previously announced $2.2 billion acquisition of FHP International Corp.</p>
<p>The combined company will serve nearly four million commercial and Medicare members in 15 states and Guam, making PacifiCare the nation's fifth largest health maintenance organization company.</p>
<p>Revenue of the combined company is expected to total more than $10 billion in 1997.</p>
<p>The acquired California-based FHP runs a multi-state HMO operation.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
